<title>NETHERLANDS: SIMAC RAISES 1996 NET PROFIT.</title>
<headline>SIMAC RAISES 1996 NET PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     2.76 vs   2.08</p>
<p>    Net profit			     4.8  vs   3.6</p>
<p>    Turnover			     297.4  vs 173.8</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     9.2  vs   6.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Simac Techniek said it expected further growth of</p>
<p>turnover and profits in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
